<dispatchitem code="00013893.0006001" func-code="28-26-01" item-list-nbr="01" revdate="2019-05-22T00:00:00"><title>Center Tank Transfer Valve</title><ditembody nb-installed="2"><dispcond code="00013893.0006001.001" dispcond-id="D07171" dispcond-label="B" lid="N.00013893.0006001.001"><title>One inoperative closed</title><normal-dispcond nb-required="1" rectification-interval="C"><placard/><remark><requirement lid="N.00013893.0006001.002" req-id="R07172"><opsproc-ref><duref product="MMEL" ref="00013913"/></opsproc-ref><qualifiers><qualifier value="CREW_OPS"/></qualifiers><para code="00013893.0006001.002" layer="1" lid="N.00013893.0006001.003">One may
be inoperative in the closed position provided that the flight routes
permit a landing at a suitable airport if the remaining center tank
transfer valve fails with fuel in the center tank and in any <abb>ACT</abb>.</para></requirement></remark></normal-dispcond></dispcond><dispcond code="00013893.0006001.003" dispcond-id="D07173" dispcond-label="E" lid="N.00013893.0006001.004"><title>Both inoperative closed</title><normal-dispcond nb-required="0" rectification-interval="C"><placard/><remark><requirement lid="N.00013893.0006001.005" req-id="R07174"><qualifiers><qualifier value="LOADSHEET"/><qualifier value="FUEL_PLANNING"/><qualifier value="REFUEL"/></qualifiers><para code="00013893.0006001.004" layer="1" lid="N.00013893.0006001.006">Both may be inoperative in the closed
position provided that there is no fuel in any <abb>ACT</abb> and
the center tank or the fuel in any <abb>ACT</abb> and the center tank
is considered as not usable and as part of the <abb>ZFW</abb> and
is taken into account for <abb>CG</abb> determination.</para></requirement></remark></normal-dispcond></dispcond><dispcond code="00013893.0006001.005" dispcond-id="D07175" dispcond-label="F" lid="N.00013893.0006001.007"><title>One or both inoperative open</title><normal-dispcond nb-required="0" rectification-interval="C"><placard/><remark><requirement lid="N.00013893.0006001.008" req-id="R07176"><qualifiers><qualifier value="REFUEL"/></qualifiers><para code="00013893.0006001.007" layer="1" lid="N.00013893.0006001.010">One or both may be inoperative in the open position provided that
there is no fuel in the center tank and in any <abb>ACT</abb>.</para></requirement></remark></normal-dispcond></dispcond></ditembody></dispatchitem>